{"created": "2025-09-10T15:00:43.380189+00:00", "modified": "2025-09-10T15:00:43.936315+00:00", "id": 16877102, "conceptrecid": "16877101", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.16877101", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "metadata": {"title": "GW250114 discovery paper figure scripts", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "publication_date": "2025-09-10", "description": "<p>This data release, <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102/draft/files/GW250114_data_release.tar.gz/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GW250114_data_release.tar.gz</a>, contains code and data required to reproduce the figures in the GW250114 discovery paper and its supplement.</p>\n<p>It contains the following folders:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>figures</code>, which containes saved versions of all the paper's plots;</li>\n<li><code>data</code>, which contains the analysis results, except for the posterior samples;</li>\n<li><code>scripts</code>, which contains all the code required to reproduce the plots. Additionally, it contains scripts and notebooks used to compute the numbers quoted in the paper.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It also contains the file <code>pyproject.toml</code>, which outlines the project's dependencies.</p>\n<p>Instructions for how to run the scripts, as well as which script corresponds to which plot, can be found in the file <code>scripts/README</code>.</p>\n<p>Posterior samples for all approximants are provided separately.</p>\n<p>Some figures (1, 3 and 4) can be reproduced without these posterior samples, while the others require them. In order to reproduce all figures, download the posterior samples to the <code>data</code> folder. All figures except for figure 6 can be reproduced with only posterior_samples_NRSur7dq4.h5.</p>\n<p>An additional NRSur7dq4 run is provided in this data release; it was performed without accounting for detector calibration.</p>\n<p>The <code>scripts</code> folder also includes scripts that were used to compute several numbers quoted in the paper, such as the significance of the area law test.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "LIGO Scientific Collaboration, Virgo Collaboration and KAGRA Collaboration", "affiliation": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.7935/1g4j-2028", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}], "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "inactive", "title": {"en": "Inactive"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Journal article", "type": "publication", "subtype": "article"}, "journal": {"title": "Physical Review Letters"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "ligo-virgo-kagra"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "16877101"}}]}}, "title": "GW250114 discovery paper figure scripts", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16877102", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16877102?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16877102", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877101", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16877101", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16877101", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16877101", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16877102/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16877102/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16877102/versions/latest", "latest_html":